[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.829, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "低。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2165.43, "timestamp": "00:36:05", "text": "大家好。你好。嘿。我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.91, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "我们都到齐了。我的天啊。我喜欢它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2170.63, "timestamp": "00:36:10", "text": "我喜欢我们头部移动的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2173.51, "timestamp": "00:36:13", "text": "那。太搞笑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.15, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "哦，对了，我能……你能……吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2178.39, "timestamp": "00:36:18", "text": "各位，请在Discord上把我静音，这样我就不会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2180.63, "timestamp": "00:36:20", "text": "可以设置 Discord 的互动消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2184.55, "timestamp": "00:36:24", "text": "不要屏蔽我，请为我辩护。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2193.51, "timestamp": "00:36:33", "text": "好的。好的。好的。好的。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2200.71, "timestamp": "00:36:40", "text": "嗯，我们慢慢地，就这样越来越近了。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2202.63, "timestamp": "00:36:42", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2205.75, "timestamp": "00:36:45", "text": "为什么我会看到它？因为我能听到你的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2206.829, "timestamp": "00:36:46", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2208.71, "timestamp": "00:36:48", "text": "回声。有趣的。哦，是的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2210.87, "timestamp": "00:36:50", "text": "两次。呃，所以我才说“做”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2213.91, "timestamp": "00:36:53", "text": "哦，你当然可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2216.069, "timestamp": "00:36:56", "text": "我该怎么做？呃，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2218.069, "timestamp": "00:36:58", "text": "耳机图标。"}]